How to Test the Server:

  🔧 Easy Testing Instructions:

  1. Start the Fixed Server:
  cd "D:\Gsoc Gitlab\ocean\breakwater\mcp"
  python ultimate_fastmcp_server.py
  1. The server now runs on port 8021 with all our fixes!
  2. Test the Fixes:
  cd "D:\Gsoc Gitlab\ocean\breakwater\mcp"
  python simple_test.py

  🔍 What You'll See if Fixes Work:
  - ✅ LLM Sampling: Large response with fallback content (not "Client does not support sampling")
  - ✅ Configuration Generator: No parameter validation errors
  - ✅ All 6 tools available including sampling tools

  ⚠️ What You'll See if Server Needs Restart:
  - ❌ LLM Sampling: "Client does not support sampling" error
  - ❌ Configuration Generator: "Unexpected keyword argument" errors